# Generated: rebuilt from scratch by build_integration.py (install.sh reads it from disk; pytest stages into a temp dir)
Source/Model/integration/Assets/
# Per-task review renders (kept locally for the audits); preview/hero/ and preview/blocks/ stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/task-*/
# Visual pass 1 raw audit renders (regenerate: DC_PREVIEW=vp1); the before|after pair sheets stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/visual-pass-1/before/
Source/Model/preview/visual-pass-1/after/*.png
Source/Model/preview/visual-pass-2/before/
Source/Model/preview/visual-pass-2/after/*.png
# Plan 2 per-task raw renders (regenerate: DC_PREVIEW=plan2-t1 ...); pair sheets and contact sheets stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/p2-task-*/before/
Source/Model/preview/p2-task-*/after/
# Plan 4 Task 7 KVM motion frames (regenerate: DC_PREVIEW=plan4, see dc/preview_scripts.py)
Source/Model/preview/plan4/frames/
# ... and its videos, GIFs and contact sheets (regenerated with the frames); the SVG charts and the four stills stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/plan4/*.mp4
Source/Model/preview/plan4/*.gif
Source/Model/preview/plan4/kvm_*_sheet.png
# Plan 4 scripts: the offline compile check and the core test runner build outputs, and the folder se2mod.py build
# moves Scripts/ to while the SDK builder runs (restored afterwards)
Tests/CompileCheck/bin/
Tests/CompileCheck/obj/
Tests/CoreTests/bin/
Tests/CoreTests/obj/
.Scripts.hidden-for-build/
# Plan 2 Task 9b: raw fracture preview panels (regenerate: p2t9b_preview.py); the sheets stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/p2-task-9b/panels/
# Plan 4 Task 9 use-box renders (regenerate: DC_PREVIEW=plan4 DC_SHOTS=kvm_use, dc/preview_use_boxes.py)
Source/Model/preview/plan4/kvm_use_*.png
# Plan 2 Task 9c: raw fracture refinement panels (regenerate: p2t9c_preview.py); the sheets stay tracked
Source/Model/preview/p2-task-9c/panels/

# Preview renders are generated on disk for viewing but stay out of git (policy); marketing images live in docs/media/
Source/Model/preview/
